 "remarks": "Very attractive 3 bedroom cape with welcoming front porch and perfect, private property in a fabulous walk-to-train location. Newer mechanicals, Thermopane windows throughout and refinished hardwood floors on the main level, this charming home is truly move-in ready. The living room includes a raised-hearth fireplace with a distinctive brick accent wall, and extensive custom woodwork and built-in bookcases. The main level primary bedroom is freshly painted and boasts brand new wall to wall carpeting and 2 closets. The adjacent full bath is updated, clean and bright and includes marble tile finishes. The open family room with custom wainscoting leads to an oversized deck and patio overlooking the sunny, level and very private rear yard. Back inside, the family room is also open to the updated kitchen offering stainless steel appliances and abundant storage with plenty of room for meal prep and entertaining in the adjacent dining room. Upstairs there are two ample bedrooms with deep closets plus attic storage and room for easy expansion if desired. Tremendous value for the neighborhood and condition. A very happy and well loved home ready for someone to enjoy.",
